      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: i'm dreaming of a white christmas; hasOverallIntent: Overall Intent; overall-intent-description: The image displays a festive, snowy Christmas scene with snow-covered pine branches and soft, glowing lights, evoking a cozy, holiday atmosphere. The text 'i'm dreaming of a white christmas' is overlaid in bold white font. There is no toxicity present in this image. The meme's intent is to evoke nostalgia or romanticize the idea of a snowy Christmas, using the visual of winter and holiday lights to complement the sentiment expressed in the text. The juxtaposition of the text with the serene winter imagery creates an emotional appeal, likely intended to trigger feelings of warmth, longing, or seasonal cheer. No harmful, hateful, abusive, cyberbullying, misogynistic, or propagandistic content is present.",
