      "instance_name": "song_title",
      "label": "Song Title",
      "description": "The phrase 'I'm dreaming of a white Christmas' is the title of a famous Christmas song originally written by Irving Berlin and first performed by Bing Crosby in 1942. The song is a staple of holiday music and evokes nostalgia and romanticized imagery of snowy winter scenes, which is directly reflected in the visual content of the image. Understanding the cultural significance and widespread recognition of this song is essential to interpreting the meme's intent.",
