      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "holiday_music_culture",
      "label": "Holiday Music Culture",
      "description": "The meme relies on the cultural phenomenon of holiday music, particularly Christmas songs, which are deeply embedded in Western traditions. The song 'I'm Dreaming of a White Christmas' is emblematic of this tradition, often associated with warmth, nostalgia, and seasonal cheer. The image's visual elements (snow, lights, pine branches) are culturally coded to complement this musical sentiment, making the background knowledge of holiday music culture necessary to fully appreciate the meme.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
