      "label": "Romanticized Winter Imaging",
      "description": "The image and text together invoke a romanticized, idealized vision of a snowy Christmas, which is a common trope in Western media and advertising. This concept is not just about weather but about an emotional and aesthetic ideal that has been culturally constructed over decades. Understanding this trope helps explain why the image and text together create a specific nostalgic and sentimental feeling.",
